  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNDP - Go Solar: Renewable energy in East Jerusalem schools</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to reduce the operational costs of 15 public schools in East Jerusalem through investments in renewable energy, primarily solar systems installed on schools&#x2019; rooftops and in external yards. Such investments will generate clean energy while also contributing to decreasing electricity expenses of schools. Consequently, this will generating savings, which in turn can be utilised for maintenance, quality education and development purposes.</narrative>
  </description>
